      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a very heavy burden to feel like you are holding people back, but those feelings are distortions of reality, not facts. True selflessness isn't about disappearing; it's about accepting the help you need to feel better. The people who care about you want *you* to be okay, not for you to vanish so they can feel temporarily relieved. Please reach out to a professional who can help you see your value outside of this pain.",
